---
title: Sign-in and agent consent · leaving the app and coming back
---
sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  participant you as You
  participant app as Manor app
  participant web as Auth session window
  participant auth as Supabase Auth + Google
  participant bridge as Consent bridge page
  participant agent as Agent host
  you->>app: Sign in with Google
  app->>web: PKCE sign-in · return to manor://auth/callback
  web->>auth: Google consent · signup gate grant
  auth-->>app: manor://auth/callback?code=
  app->>auth: exchange code · session saved on disk
  agent->>auth: OAuth 2.1 authorization request
  auth->>bridge: site URL in the agent's window
  bridge->>app: manor://oauth/consent?authorization_id=
  you->>app: Allow access
  app->>auth: approve · manor_oauth_handoff_save
  bridge->>auth: manor_oauth_handoff_take
  bridge-->>agent: continue to the agent's callback with the code
